WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.390
Unit eighteen. Bicycle Safety!

2
00:00:04.348 --> 00:00:08.197
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.247 --> 00:00:11.485
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:15.175
Today we learn about Bicycle Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:19.746
Bicycle. Say it with me. Bicycle!

6
00:00:23.253 --> 00:00:26.553
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

7
00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:33.516
Brakes. Say it with me. Brakes!

8
00:00:36.978 --> 00:00:40.378
Road. Say it with me. Road!

9
00:00:43.879 --> 00:00:47.512
Signal. Say it with me. Signal!

10
00:00:51.011 --> 00:00:54.278
Light. Say it with me. Light!

11
00:00:57.779 --> 00:01:01.279
Traffic. Say it with me. Traffic!

12
00:01:04.776 --> 00:01:07.776
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:11.278 --> 00:01:20.657
Before I ride my bicycle, I put on a helmet and check the brakes. I ride on the side of the road with the traffic and signal when I turn. A light helps others see me.

14
00:01:20.707 --> 00:01:21.857
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.103 --> 00:01:28.209
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.259 --> 00:01:29.409
Brakes!

17
00:01:30.254 --> 00:01:35.518
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.568 --> 00:01:36.718
Traffic!

19
00:01:37.521 --> 00:01:43.671
Did you know? A helmet should fit snugly and sit level on your forehead to protect you properly!

20
00:01:43.721 --> 00:01:45.654
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.471 --> 00:01:54.527
Think and answer. What should you check before riding a bicycle?

22
00:01:54.577 --> 00:01:55.727
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.938 --> 00:02:01.827
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:04.471
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

